seed 1: Quest: locate a sealed chest, for a merchant on thin ice.
Location: Silver Hearth
Complication: the weather turns against you.
Reward: a map to somewhere promising. If it fails: the town goes hungry this winter.
seed 2: Quest: locate a map torn in half, for a grieving widow.
Location: Amber Hearth
Complication: a rival party wants the same thing.
Reward: a rare tool of good make. If it fails: someone innocent is blamed.
seed 3: Quest: track down a lost family heirloom, for a sharp-tongued innkeeper.
Location: Bright Mill
Complication: someone is following you.
Reward: a map to somewhere promising. If it fails: someone innocent is blamed.
